{
  "title": "Contact Us | Michelle Barratt Psychology",
  "description": "Book online, call 07 3185 0040 or email our administration team. We respond within 24–48 hours.",
  "html": "<!--$--><section class=\"bg-gradient-to-br from-plum to-rose text-white\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-5xl px-5 py-14 md:py-20\"><div><p class=\"text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-white/85 mb-3\">Contact us</p><h1 class=\"text-white text-[32px] md:text-[44px] font-semibold leading-[1.08] max-w-3xl\">Walking Beside You on the Journey to Wellbeing</h1><div class=\"h-[3px] w-16 bg-sun my-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><div class=\"max-w-2xl text-[16px] md:text-[17px] text-white/95 space-y-3\"><p>Psychology Services That Support Growth, Healing, and Resilience. Easy ways to connect with us and find professional support.</p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"bg-blush \"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-7xl px-5 py-14 md:py-20 \"><div class=\"grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-3\"><div class=\"bg-white rounded p-7 border border-lilac flex flex-col gap-3\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-calendar-check h-7 w-7 text-ocean\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M8 2v4\"></path><path d=\"M16 2v4\"></path><rect width=\"18\" height=\"18\" x=\"3\" y=\"4\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M3 10h18\"></path><path d=\"m9 16 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><h2 class=\"text-3xl font-semibold\">Online Booking</h2><p class=\"text-[15px]\">For online bookings – please select the <strong>correct fee option:</strong> on the Booking Page, scroll down to choose the fees <strong>matching the qualifications</strong> of the practitioner you want to meet with – either <strong>General Psychologist</strong> or <strong>Clinical Psychologist.</strong></p><div class=\"mt-auto pt-2\"><a class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center min-h-12 px-7 rounded whitespace-nowrap text-[13px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] transition-colors duration-300 bg-rose text-white hover:bg-[#9d2a59] \" href=\"/practitioners\">Online Booking</a></div></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded p-7 border border-lilac flex flex-col gap-3\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-phone h-7 w-7 text-ocean\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-8.63-3.07 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-3.07-8.67A2 2 0 0 1 4.11 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.72 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 .7 2.81 2 2 0 0 1-.45 2.11L8.09 9.91a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.27-1.27a2 2 0 0 1 2.11-.45 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 2.81.7A2 2 0 0 1 22 16.92z\"></path></svg><h2 class=\"text-3xl font-semibold\">Telephone</h2><p class=\"text-[15px]\"><strong>To call us:</strong> our call hours are Monday to Friday 9:00am to 5:00pm. Please note: email is often the fastest way to reach us.</p><a href=\"tel:0731850040\" class=\"mt-auto pt-2 text-xl font-semibold text-plum underline underline-offset-4\">Phone: <!-- -->07 3185 0040</a></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded p-7 border border-lilac flex flex-col gap-3\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-mail h-7 w-7 text-ocean\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"20\" height=\"16\" x=\"2\" y=\"4\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"m22 7-8.97 5.7a1.94 1.94 0 0 1-2.06 0L2 7\"></path></svg><h2 class=\"text-3xl font-semibold\">Email</h2><a href=\"mailto:admin@michellebarrattpsychology.com.au\" class=\"font-semibold text-plum underline underline-offset-4 break-all\">admin@michellebarrattpsychology.com.au</a><p class=\"text-[15px]\">(Preferred Contact Method) — or fill in our contact form below, and we will be in touch within <strong>24–48 hours</strong>.</p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"bg-soft \"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-7xl px-5 py-14 md:py-20 \"><div class=\"grid lg:grid-cols-5 gap-12\"><div class=\"lg:col-span-2\"><div class=\"mb-8 md:mb-10 max-w-3xl  \"><p class=\"text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] mb-2.5 text-rose\">Have questions?</p><h2 class=\"text-[30px] md:text-[42px] font-semibold leading-[1.1] \">We Are Here to Help</h2><div class=\"h-[3px] w-14 bg-sun mt-4 \" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div></div><p class=\"mb-4\">Seeking support can feel overwhelming, but you do not have to navigate life&#x27;s challenges alone. Our administration team can help answer your questions, explain appointment options and connect you with a suitable practitioner.</p><p><strong>Please be aware that you will receive a response in 24 to 48 hours.</strong> If in crisis, please call 000.</p></div><div class=\"lg:col-span-3\"><div data-mbp=\"contact-form\"></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"bg-blush \"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-7xl px-5 py-14 md:py-20 \"><div class=\"mb-8 md:mb-10 max-w-3xl  \"><p class=\"text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] mb-2.5 text-rose\">Where you can get support</p><h2 class=\"text-[30px] md:text-[42px] font-semibold leading-[1.1] \">Psychology Services Across Brisbane &amp; Australia</h2><div class=\"h-[3px] w-14 bg-sun mt-4 \" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><p class=\"mt-5 text-[17px] leading-relaxed text-ink/85\">Our psychologists provide support to children, adolescents, adults, couples and families from convenient Brisbane locations, including Toowong, Manly-West and surrounding suburbs, as well as Online Therapy appointments for clients throughout Australia.</p></div><div class=\"grid gap-5 lg:grid-cols-3\"><article class=\"bg-white rounded border border-lilac p-6 md:p-7 flex flex-col h-full\"><h3 class=\"text-2xl md:text-[26px] font-semibold leading-tight mb-2\">Toowong Psychology Services</h3><p class=\"text-[15px] text-ink/80 mb-3\">Access professional psychological support from our Toowong location, supporting individuals, couples and families across Brisbane&#x27;s inner-west.</p><dl class=\"divide-y divide-lilac mt-1 border-t border-lilac\"><div class=\"flex gap-3 py-3\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map-pin h-[18px] w-[18px] text-ocean shrink-0 mt-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg><div><dt class=\"block text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-ink/55 mb-0.5\">Location</dt><dd class=\"text-[15px] leading-snug\"><a class=\"underline decoration-ocean/40 underline-offset-4 hover:decoration-ocean\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Suite+37+Level+1+2+Benson+Street+Toowong+QLD+4066\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Suite 37, Level 1, 2 Benson Street, Toowong, 4066</a></dd></div></div><div class=\"flex gap-3 py-3\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-phone h-[18px] w-[18px] text-ocean shrink-0 mt-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-8.63-3.07 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-3.07-8.67A2 2 0 0 1 4.11 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.72 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 .7 2.81 2 2 0 0 1-.45 2.11L8.09 9.91a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.27-1.27a2 2 0 0 1 2.11-.45 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 2.81.7A2 2 0 0 1 22 16.92z\"></path></svg><div><dt class=\"block text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-ink/55 mb-0.5\">Phone</dt><dd class=\"text-[15px] leading-snug\"><a class=\"font-medium text-plum underline decoration-ocean/40 underline-offset-4 hover:decoration-ocean\" href=\"tel:0731850040\">07 3185 