0 0 0 6 6l1.27-1.27a2 2 0 0 1 2.11-.45 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 2.81.7A2 2 0 0 1 22 16.92z\"></path></svg><div><dt class=\"block text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-ink/55 mb-0.5\">Phone</dt><dd class=\"text-[15px] leading-snug\"><a class=\"font-medium text-plum underline decoration-ocean/40 underline-offset-4 hover:decoration-ocean\" href=\"tel:0731850040\">07 3185 0040</a></dd></div></div><div class=\"flex gap-3 py-3\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-printer h-[18px] w-[18px] text-ocean shrink-0 mt-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6 18H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h16a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v5a2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-2\"></path><path d=\"M6 9V3a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h10a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v6\"></path><rect x=\"6\" y=\"14\" width=\"12\" height=\"8\" rx=\"1\"></rect></svg><div><dt class=\"block text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-ink/55 mb-0.5\">Secure Fax</dt><dd class=\"text-[15px] leading-snug\">07 3009 0075</dd></div></div><div class=\"flex gap-3 py-3\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-clock h-[18px] w-[18px] text-ocean shrink-0 mt-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><polyline points=\"12 6 12 12 16 14\"></polyline></svg><div><dt class=\"block text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-ink/55 mb-0.5\">Schedule</dt><dd class=\"text-[15px] leading-snug\">Mon – Fri · 9:00 am – 5:00 pm</dd></div></div></dl><div class=\"mt-auto pt-5 flex flex-wrap gap-2.5\"><a class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center min-h-12 px-7 rounded whitespace-nowrap text-[13px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] transition-colors duration-300 bg-rose text-white hover:bg-[#9d2a59] \" href=\"/practitioners\">Book Online</a><a href=\"https://michellebarrattpsychology.com.au/psychologist-manly-west/\" class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center min-h-12 px-7 rounded whitespace-nowrap text-[13px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] transition-colors duration-300 border border-plum text-plum hover:bg-lilac \" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">More Details</a></div></article><article class=\"bg-white rounded border border-lilac p-6 md:p-7 flex flex-col h-full\"><h3 class=\"text-2xl md:text-[26px] font-semibold leading-tight mb-2\">Online Therapy Australia-Wide</h3><p class=\"text-[15px] text-ink/80 mb-3\">Access professional psychological support from anywhere in Australia, in the privacy of your own home, wherever you are located.</p><dl class=\"divide-y divide-lilac mt-1 border-t border-lilac\"><div class=\"flex gap-3 py-3\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map-pin h-[18px] w-[18px] text-ocean shrink-0 mt-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg><div><dt class=\"block text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-ink/55 mb-0.5\">Location</dt><dd class=\"text-[15px] leading-snug\">Secure Telehealth from anywhere in Australia</dd></div></div><div class=\"flex gap-3 py-3\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-phone h-[18px] w-[18px] text-ocean shrink-0 mt-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-8.63-3.07 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-3.07-8.67A2 2 0 0 1 4.11 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.72 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 .7 2.81 2 2 0 0 1-.45 2.11L8.09 9.91a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.27-1.27a2 2 0 0 1 2.11-.45 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 2.81.7A2 2 0 0 1 22 16.92z\"></path></svg><div><dt class=\"block text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-ink/55 mb-0.5\">Phone</dt><dd class=\"text-[15px] leading-snug\"><a class=\"font-medium text-plum underline decoration-ocean/40 underline-offset-4 hover:decoration-ocean\" href=\"tel:0731850040\">07 3185 0040</a></dd></div></div><div class=\"flex gap-3 py-3\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-clock h-[18px] w-[18px] text-ocean shrink-0 mt-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><polyline points=\"12 6 12 12 16 14\"></polyline></svg><div><dt class=\"block text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-ink/55 mb-0.5\">Schedule</dt><dd class=\"text-[15px] leading-snug\">Flexible appointments · 7 days</dd></div></div></dl><div class=\"mt-auto pt-5 flex flex-wrap gap-2.5\"><a class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center min-h-12 px-7 rounded whitespace-nowrap text-[13px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] transition-colors duration-300 bg-rose text-white hover:bg-[#9d2a59] \" href=\"/practitioners\">Book Online</a><a href=\"https://michellebarrattpsychology.com.au/online-therapy/\" class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center min-h-12 px-7 rounded whitespace-nowrap text-[13px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] transition-colors duration-300 border border-plum text-plum hover:bg-lilac \" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">More Details</a></div></article></div></div></section><section class=\"bg-lilac \"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-7xl px-5 py-14 md:py-20 \"><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-10\"><div><h2 class=\"text-3xl font-semibold mb-3\">Your Privacy and Confidentiality</h2><p class=\"text-[15px]\">Michelle Barratt Psychology manages your Privacy and Confidentiality extremely seriously and adheres to the strict Allied Health Privacy ACT of 1988 and will not use any of your personal information for advertisement.</p></div><div><h2 class=\"text-3xl font-semibold mb-3\">In Case of Emergency</h2><p class=\"text-[15px] mb-4\">If you have an emergency at any time, please contact <strong>000</strong> immediately. Please click the Crisis Support button below for further support.</p><a href=\"https://michellebarrattpsychology.com.au/crisis-support/\" class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center min-h-12 px-7 rounded whitespace-nowrap text-[13px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] transition-colors duration-300 bg-ocean text-white hover:bg-[#095a6f] \" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Crisis Support</a></div><div><h2 class=\"text-3xl font-semibold mb-3\">Appointment Costs</h2><ul class=\"list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 text-[15px]\"><li>The appointment cost table is extensive, due to varying appointment costs for the different types of client categories, such as for: Children, Individuals, Couples &amp; Families.</li><li>Additionally there are clients who will fall under different fee-paying structures such as: Full Fee Paying Clients, Concession Clients and Bulk Billing Clients.</li><li>The fee type, client payment structure, and the length of time your appointment takes will all affect the cost of your appointment.</li><li><strong>Your fees may be better discussed with our Administration Team at the time of your booking, to clarify your unique circumstances and needs.</strong></li></ul></div></div></div></section><!--/$-->"
}